# Judgement reads the durable policy instead of the silo's held one.
MODULE: JudgedByHeldPolicyReadsDurable
TARGET: JudgedByHeldPolicy
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an entry is judged by the durable policy, not the held one
PERTURBS: Judge

--- FIND
       THEN /\ judged' = seen
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], seen) THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- REPLACE
       THEN /\ judged' = pol
            /\ rphase' = IF Refused(val[cur], pol) THEN "DeadLettering" ELSE "Committing"
--- END